{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"H2已建立他在亲近中尝到温柔的满足，因此用刚才的满足解释此刻身心放松、安静享受惬意，有明确的历史依据和因果关系。满足带来的松弛能够支持S03-B1中歌声退去后的舒适沉默、陶醉与暂时不去哪里的状态，并非只是宣布感受结果。不过，这条解释主要抓住了安适的一面，对心神漂远的恍惚感以及随后出现的急切和阻滞尚未给出原因。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S03-B1：身体随水波摇晃、漂浮，心神逐渐漂远、略微走神的感觉尚未得到充分解释。\",\"S03-B2：短促而稍显急切的念头为何突然冒出，又迅速沉回去。\",\"S03-B3：原本舒适顺畅的流动为何出现暗流般的拖拽、滞留，以及思绪纷乱、难以拼合的阻力感。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "75bfc82b-5ff2-424f-8ab4-14b99bc96076", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045431914047Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.969, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:54:50.884020+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d2e4de6fc94aed8e55ffee3acbb2e373085e831cdc6b81abaec61b2c83d29154", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence